/-!
# Kernel non-vacuity of the `allFeatures` relation on T1 (E2E-M11h)

T1 = `d3c8/d3/02-h10196-s3` (plan §4.1): one incoming receipt, one FunctionCall to the
pre-state `d3tiny` contract (`run`), nearcore cold validator `ok`. `decide +kernel` evaluates the
whole checker (`acceptsSuccessor` at `allFeatures`) on T1's claim and witness bytes; the bridge
